  "description": "``done`` with output links (200), or the still-running run (202).",
  "examples": [
    {
      "done": true,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "content_type": "application/zip",
          "crc32c": "4waSgw==",
          "expires_at": "2026-10-15T09:45:00Z",
          "generation": 7,
